                                "sense_id": "0136a2e2-5534-3eee-a0db-b89f8c8965c2",
                                "text": "The optical beam entering from the top is reflected at the bottom of the superstrate coated by a dielectric mirror and thus samples the fringent electric field between the electrodes which penetrates into the crystal."
